# Live Chapter 1 content, ported from existing scenes; Codex integration 2026-09-09.
NPC: almy
LOCATION: boardinghouse

TOPIC: default
  GATE: NOT topic_done(almy, default) AND coat = plain
  TAG: almy_plain
  MRS. ALMY: "The coat changes the room before Walter says a word.\nMrs. Almy sets a second cup beside the first."
  MRS. ALMY: "You came to ask about Naomi.\n\nSit, then. Ask properly."

TOPIC: default
  GATE: NOT topic_done(almy, default)
  TAG: almy_badge
  MRS. ALMY: "If you've come to tell me what the paper says, Officer,\nI have already read it."
  WALTER CORWIN: "I'm asking about the woman and the boy."
  MRS. ALMY: "The paper wasn't.\n\nWhat is it you intend to write down?"

TOPIC: identify
  GATE: always
  TAG: identify
  LABEL: "Ask for the woman's name"
  TIME: 4
  WALTER CORWIN: "I counted eight people.\nI would like to put a name beside each of them."
  MRS. ALMY: "Naomi Freeman.\n\nShe ate here. The boy too.\nHe waited for her to begin before touching his own plate."
  NOTEBOOK: "NAOMI FREEMAN.\nIdentified by Mrs. Almy, Pickman Street.\nBoy accompanying her: name still to be established."
  MRS. ALMY: "You can ask me again tomorrow.\nHer name will still be Naomi."
  EVIDENCE: naomi

TOPIC: lay_lead
  GATE: evidence(naomi)
  TAG: lay_lead
  LABEL: "Ask what brought Naomi to town"
  TIME: 4
  MRS. ALMY: "She was looking for something owed.\nA whaler's wages. A share, she called it. A lay.\nFrom her family's time, long before hers."
  WALTER CORWIN: "Did you see the document?"
  MRS. ALMY: "No. She spoke of finding it.\nYou mustn't write that I saw it."
  NOTEBOOK: "Possible wage claim. Document not examined.\nSource: Mrs. Almy's recollection.\n\nA question to pursue.\nNo conclusion about why Naomi died."
  EVIDENCE: lay_lead

TOPIC: service_work
  GATE: evidence(naomi)
  TAG: service_work
  LABEL: "Ask about work at the estate"
  TIME: 4
  MRS. ALMY: "She asked about work at the estate.\nCleaning, perhaps. They always need someone who can leave by the other door."
  WALTER CORWIN: "Who engaged her?"
  MRS. ALMY: "I don't know.\nThe steward has books enough.\nAsk him for one that contains her."
  EVIDENCE: service_work

TOPIC: almy_ledger
  GATE: evidence(naomi)
  TAG: almy_ledger
  LABEL: "Ask to corroborate the visit in her ledger"
  MRS. ALMY: "On the sideboard.\nCopy the entry, if you need it.\nThe book stays here."

TOPIC: almy_trust
  GATE: coat = plain AND NOT topic_done(almy, almy_trust)
  TAG: almy_trust
  LABEL: "Ask why the coat made a difference"
  MRS. ALMY: "A uniform asks what belongs in a report.\nA man might still ask what happened.\n\nI haven't decided which you are yet."
  NOTEBOOK: almy_trust_1_1 | "Mrs. Almy distinguished speaking to a uniform from speaking to a man. The name she supplied was the same."

